<title>UK: Devro H1 profits down after exceptionals.</title>
<headline>Devro H1 profits down after exceptionals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.3		    vs 7.5</p>
<p> Shr pre-exceptionals   7.5		    vs 7.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.8		    vs 2.6</p>
<p> Pretax		     6.33		   vs 14.67</p>
<p> Turnover		   147.92		 vs 47.21</p>
<p>NOTE - Sausage skin maker Devro Plc said pretax profit was after charging 10 million stg for inegration of its acquisition of Teepak, as announced in March, and a 4.5 million charge for stock write-offs in relation to BSE or &quot;mad cow' disease.</p>
</text>
